{"Title":"An Act further regulating the Year-round Market Rate Rental Housing Trust Fund in the town of Provincetown","BillNumber":"S2951","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JAC0","Name":"Julian Cyr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAC0","ResponseDate":"2024-09-12T11:08:26.34"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JAC0","Name":"Julian Cyr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAC0","ResponseDate":"2024-09-12T11:08:26.34"},{"Id":"SKP1","Name":"Sarah K. Peake","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SKP1","ResponseDate":"2024-04-19T11:39:56.5366667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2951/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"Senate, September  30, 2024 - New draft (Senator Cyr) to Senate Bill amending chapter 305 of the acts of 2016 relative to the year-round market rate rental housing trust fund in the town of Provincetown (Senate, No. 2744).","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 1 of chapter 305 of the acts of 2016 is hereby amended by inserting after the word \"units\", the first time it appears, the following words:- and year-round ownership opportunities. \r\n\tSECTION 2. Subsection (a) of section 2 of said chapter 305 is hereby amended by striking out the first sentence and inserting in place thereof the following sentence:- The trust shall be managed by a board of trustees consisting of 5 members and 2 alternate members. \r\n\tSECTION 3. Clause (iii) of said subsection (a) of said section 2 of said chapter 305 is hereby amended by inserting after the word “members” the following words:- and 2 alternate members.\r\n\tSECTION 4. Section 3 of said chapter 305 is hereby amended by striking out the words “Year-round Market Rate Rental Housing Trust Fund” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- Year-Round Market Rate Housing Trust Fund.\r\n\tSECTION 5. Section 5 of said chapter 305 is hereby amended by inserting the following word after the word \"rental\" the following words:- or ownership. \r\n\tSECTION 6. This act shall take effect upon its passage. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S31"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}